        "y": 1200
      },
      "text": "BULKHEAD = ONE DRB102 CONNECTOR (Daniel 2026-10-12, shared-connector rule). bh_b_eng is the whole 102-cavity plug with TE's cavity numbers. A and B are only our names for its sections. Cavities marked N/C here are wired on ST185-A-engine - see ST185-A-engine (DRB 1-2, 9-42, 44-47, 50-53, 56-59, 61); their contacts and sealing plugs are counted there."
    }
  ],
